                                "sense_id": "98d4b64d-4a6b-30a6-977f-29af5395cca7",
                                "text": "Henchmen had placed, as was their habit, each warrior's gear and trappings above his pile of skins. Thus you could see the burnished helmet of each warrior set in readiness above his head. It was the Viking habit."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
